# Related Tools (local installs)

Absolute paths on this machine. Prefer these over outdated wiki defaults (Yabber, Yapped, DS Map Studio).

| Tool | Path | Role |
|------|------|------|
| **Smithbox** | `S:\Smithbox` | Param / map / model editor (successor to DS Map Studio / Yapped) |
| **WitchyBND** | `S:\WitchyBND` | BND / DCX archive (un)packing (successor to Yabber) |
| **DSAnimStudio (DSAS)** | `S:\_modding\tools\DSAnimStudio` | **Source + parity reference** for character assembly, skeleton mapping, dummy transforms, weapon attach (`NewChrAsm`, `NewSkeletonMapper`, `NewDummyPolyManager`). Notes/materials also at `S:\the-heolstor-files\dsas` |
| **Mod Engine 3 (ME3)** | (runtime loader) | Mod loading in-game; installers built from `S:\souls-script-kt` (`mod-installer` module) |
| **hksc** | `S:\hksc` | HavokScript compiler |
| **DSLuaDecompiler** | `S:\DSLuaDecompiler` | HKS / Lua decompiler |
| **fromsoftware-rs** | `S:\fromsoftware-rs` | Rust introspection + cereus_debug placement overlay |
| **Elden Ring** | `S:\SteamLibrary\steamapps\common\ELDEN RING\Game` | Game install |
| **Nightreign** | `S:\SteamLibrary\steamapps\common\ELDEN RING NIGHTREIGN` | Game install |

## In-repo libraries (git submodules)

| Library | Path | Role |
|---------|------|------|
| **soulstruct** | `io_soulstruct_lib/soulstruct/` | Core Python library: binders, FLVER, MSB, params, etc. |
| **soulstruct-havok** | `io_soulstruct_lib/soulstruct-havok/` | Havok / HKX / animation support |

Submodule changes: commit **inside the submodule first**, then bump the pointer in this repo (`chore(submodules): …` — see `.cursor/rules/commit-messages.mdc`).

